@Notifications.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5014
@Token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Health Check (Live)
GET {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Health Check (Ready - includes Database check)
GET {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Push Notification (Internal Event Producer)
POST {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/internal/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "social-api",
  "eventId": "evt-001-test",
  "type": "direct-message",
  "title": "New Message Received",
  "body": "Ahmed sent you a direct message.",
  "data": "{\"conversationId\": 123}",
  "recipientIds": [
    "user-12345"
  ]
}

### List Notifications for Current User (Paged)
GET {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/notifications?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### List Unread Notifications Only
GET {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/notifications?page=1&pageSize=10&unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Unread Notification Count
GET {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### Mark Single Notification As Read
PATCH {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Mark All Notifications As Read
POST {{Notifications.API_HostAddress}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
